HOW TO INSTALL

Get the following files:

DeepForest.tar.gz
cgi-bin.tar.gz
version1_0.tar.gz

Put DeepForest.tar.gz to /usr/local/etc/httpd/htdocs.
Put cgi-bin.tar.gz to /usr/local/etc/httpd.
Put version1_0.tar.gz to $HOME/DeepForest.

Extract them in each directory.

Link /usr/local/etc/httpd/htdocs/DeepForest/doc to
$HOME/DeepForest/version1_0/doc/doc.

Make in  $HOME/DeepForest/version1_0/.

Run your httpd.



